sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant Bill as Biller mock
    participant Int as Biller Integration
    participant Rec as Reconciliation
    participant Pay as Payment Processing
    participant Acc as Accounts and Wallet
    participant Notif as Notifications
    participant Aud as Audit Log

    Note over Pay: Payment of 352.50 EGP is held and is in state SentToBiller or Unknown

    alt Trigger A - biller refuses a live payment
        Bill-->>Int: Refusal with error code
        Int-->>Pay: REFUSED with mapped reason
        Pay->>Pay: SentToBiller to Failed
    else Trigger B - Unknown payment, retry or callback says refused
        Int-->>Pay: REFUSED from re-query or callback
        Pay->>Pay: Unknown to Failed
    else Trigger C - Unknown payment, settlement file does not list it
        Rec->>Pay: Settlement file has no record of this reference
        Pay->>Pay: Unknown to Failed
    end

    Pay->>Aud: Record transition to Failed with cause
    Note over Pay,Acc: Only a Failed payment may be refunded. An Unknown payment is never refunded automatically.

    Pay->>Acc: releaseHold(352.50, payment reference)
    alt Hold was already released (duplicate call)
        Acc-->>Pay: Already released, no change
    else First release
        Acc->>Acc: One transaction posts held -352.50 and available +352.50
        Acc->>Aud: Record release with who, when and why
        Acc-->>Pay: Released
        Pay->>Pay: Failed to Refunded (final state)
        Note over Pay,Acc: No fee income is credited and no agent commission is paid
        Pay-)Notif: PaymentFailed event with reason and refund notice
        Notif-)Customer: SMS with clear reason and push message
        Note over Notif,Customer: A failed notification is retried 3 times, then marked undelivered. The payment state is not affected.
    end

    Customer->>Acc: View wallet
    Acc-->>Customer: Available balance restored, held balance reduced by 352.50
